cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and include the scan run date you used."
title: "skillscan.io: Security scan results for AI agent skills"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "AppSecHQ"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AppSecHQ/skill-scanner-test"
url: "https://skillscan.io"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "Per-skill security scan results for AI agent skills from public registries (skills.sh, ClawHub) and widely installed skill repositories, produced with Cisco AI Defense skill-scanner, with scan history, a category taxonomy mapped to the OWASP Agentic Skills Top 10, and a hand-labelled false-positive register."
keywords:
  - AI agent skills
  - agent skills security
  - prompt injection
  - supply chain security
  - SKILL.md
